   "readme": "safe-operator/README.md",
   "excerpt": [
    "# safe-operator",
    "",
    "The starter agent for **Build a Safe AI Operator** by Miro.",
    "",
    "It is a small AI operator for a small business. It watches your website and",
    "your sales, shows what it saw to a language model, and lets the model suggest",
    "**one action by name** from a closed menu. Then code, not the model, decides",
    "whether that action may happen at all.",
    "",
    "It is built to be unable to burn you:",
    "",
    "- it ships in **watch-only mode**, where nothing can act;",
    "- it has **one** function that performs actions, and that function checks",
    "  everything, in a fixed order, every time;",
    "- five kinds of action (moving money, DNS, deleting, revoking keys, changing",
    "  its own code) are **permanently denied** in code;",
    "- an unanswered approval request **expires**. It never runs on a timeout.",
    "",
    "This is course code. It is small on purpose, so you can read all of it in an",
    "evening and change it with confidence."
   ],
   "readme_lines": 156
  }
