   "readme": "Vault Kit/README.md",
   "excerpt": [
    "# Claude + Obsidian Vault Kit",
    "",
    "A starter Obsidian vault for running a small business with Claude. It is a folder of plain Markdown notes: a home page, templates for clients, projects and content, a weekly review, a prompt library, and a `CLAUDE.md` file that tells Claude how to work in the vault.",
    "",
    "Nothing here needs a plugin or an account with us. Your notes stay in this folder on your computer and open in Obsidian without an internet connection. Claude needs internet and your own Claude account.",
    "",
    "## Setup (about five minutes)",
    "",
    "1. **Install Obsidian.** Download it from https://obsidian.md and install it.",
    "2. **Unzip this kit** somewhere you keep documents, for example your Documents folder. You get a folder called `Vault Kit`. Rename it if you like, for example to your business name.",
    "3. **Open the folder as a vault.** In Obsidian, choose **Open folder as vault** and pick the folder. Open [[Home]]."
   ],
   "readme_lines": 35
  }
